---

<BaseLayout
  page="about"
  title="About Tim Gabaree | CIO & Technology Executive"
  description="Meet Tim Gabaree: CIO, technology executive, board director, Army veteran, husband, father, and lifelong learner."
  canonicalPath="/about"
  ogType="profile"
  image="/media/about-gabaree-family-800x600.webp"
  imageAlt="Tim, Carrie, Clint, and Finn in Halloween costumes"
  preloadImage={undefined}
  structuredData={structuredData}
  scripts={[]}
>
<main
  id="main-content"
  class="about-page">

  <img src="/media/background-pic-architecture-1920x942.webp" alt="" width="1920" height="942" class="page-background-image" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async">
<!-- About Section -->

  <section
    class="about-hero"
    aria-labelledby="about-title">

    <div class="about-card">

      <figure class="about-featured-photo">

        <img src="/media/about-gabaree-family-800x600.webp" alt="Tim, Carrie, Clint, and Finn in Halloween costumes" width="800" height="600" aria-describedby="image-description-about_family-1" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><span id="image-description-about_family-1" class="visually-hidden">Family selfie at a Halloween gathering. Carrie smiles from the upper left in a dark superhero-style costume, Clint wears a gray Batman costume and black mask, and Finn wears a white chef’s hat and chef costume. Tim smiles at the camera from the right, with other costumed people visible behind the family.</span>
        <figcaption>
          Every family needs a Batman and a chef. Fortunately, we have both.
        </figcaption>

      </figure>

      <div class="about-author">

        <h1 id="about-title">
          About
        </h1>

        <p>
          I’m a CIO and technology executive, independent board director, veteran, husband, father, and lifelong learner. I believe leadership is about people. My work brings people, technology, and business priorities together to solve problems and strengthen organizations.
        </p>

        <p>
          I’ve always been drawn to difficult problems and unfamiliar territory. I like learning how things work, asking questions, and bringing the right people together. My approach is practical: build on what works, fix what does not, and help people succeed.
        </p>

          <p>
          Outside of work, my family comes first. Carrie and I enjoy learning, exploring, and laughing with our sons, Clint and Finn. We visit museums and historic sites, research family history, roast coffee, and cook and bake together. Some of life’s best lessons happen far from a conference room.
        </p>

        <p>
          I’m an avid reader of science fiction and fantasy, including Douglas Adams, J.R.R. Tolkien, Jim Butcher, Terry Pratchett, Neil Gaiman, and Peter F. Hamilton. I enjoy imagination, humor, adventure, and stories that make me think. I was the kid taking things apart to see how they worked, and I still follow AI and new technology with that same curiosity.
        </p>

        <p>
          I served in the U.S. Army with the 3rd U.S. Infantry Regiment, The Old Guard. History, service, and the stories of those who came before us continue to shape how I approach leadership, family, and community.
        </p>

      </div>

    </div>

  </section>

<!-- End About Section -->

<!-- Family Gallery Section -->

  <section
    class="about-gallery-section"
    aria-labelledby="about-gallery-title">

    <div class="about-section-heading-block">

      <h2
        id="about-gallery-title"
        class="about-section-heading">
        Family Experiences
      </h2>

    </div>

    <div class="about-gallery about-gallery-featured">

      <figure class="about-gallery-large">

        <img src="/media/about-lady-liberty-finn-clint-carrie-tim-800x1067.webp" alt="Tim, Carrie, Clint, and Finn at the Statue of Liberty" width="800" height="1067" aria-describedby="image-description-about_liberty_family-1" loading="lazy" fetchpriority="auto" decoding="async"><span id="image-description-about_liberty_family-1" class="visually-hidden">Close family selfie outdoors at the Statue of Liberty. Tim, wearing sunglasses, Carrie, and Finn fill the foreground while Clint leans into the photograph from above. The Statue of Liberty rises in the background against a vivid blue sky with scattered white clouds.</span>
        <figcaption>
          Lady Liberty, Finn, Clint, Carrie, and me. Wow!
        </figcaption>

      </figure>

      <figure>

        <img src="/media/about-finn-clint-working-hard-message-800x486.webp" alt="Clint and Finn viewing an Ellis Island exhibit" width="800" height="486" aria-describedby="image-description-about_ellis_island-1" loading="lazy" fetchpriority="auto" decoding="async"><span id="image-description-about_ellis_island-1" class="visually-hidden">Clint and Finn stand side by side facing a large museum exhibit at Ellis Island. Above them, a prominent quotation describes being given nothing, having to work hard, and immigrants coming to America expecting to work harder to get anything. Historical photographs, illustrations, and interpretive panels extend across the exhibit wall.</span>
        <figcaption>
          At Ellis Island. Sometimes I wonder if we’ve lost touch with some
          of these lessons along the way.
        </figcaption>

      </figure>

      <figure>

        <img src="/media/about-gabaree-family-mt-vernon-800x600.webp" alt="Tim, Carrie, Clint, and Finn at Mount Vernon" width="800" height="600" aria-describedby="image-description-about_mount_vernon-1" loading="lazy" fetchpriority="auto" decoding="async"><span id="image-description-about_mount_vernon-1" class="visually-hidden">Family selfie outdoors at Mount Vernon. Carrie and Tim lean into the photograph from the left and right while Clint and Finn stand between them wearing caps and sunglasses. George Washington’s Mount Vernon mansion is centered behind the family beneath a bright blue sky with scattered clouds.</span>
        <figcaption>
          Fun at George and Martha Washington's house.
        </figcaption>

      </figure>

    </div>

  </section>

<!-- End Family Gallery Section -->

<!-- Personal Interests Section -->

  <section
    id="interests-and-hobbies"
    class="about-interests-section"
    aria-labelledby="about-interests-title">

    <div class="about-interests-heading-block">

      <h2
        id="about-interests-title"
        class="about-interests-heading">
        Personal Interests
      </h2>

    </div>

    <div class="about-interests-content">

      <article class="about-interests-block">

        <img src="/media/interests-and-hobbies-roasted-beans-and-espresso800x602.webp" alt="Freshly roasted coffee beans and espresso" width="800" height="602" aria-describedby="image-description-interest_coffee-1" class="about-interests-block-image" loading="lazy" fetchpriority="auto" decoding="async"><span id="image-description-interest_coffee-1" class="visually-hidden">A white ceramic cup filled with coffee rests on a matching saucer on a wooden table. Dark roasted coffee beans are scattered across the saucer and tabletop around the cup, representing Tim’s interest in home coffee roasting.</span>
        <h3 class="about-interest-caption">
          Coffee Roasting
        </h3>

      </article>

      <article class="about-interests-block">

        <img src="/media/interests-and-hobbies-chocolate-babka-800x602.webp" alt="Homemade chocolate babka" width="800" height="602" aria-describedby="image-description-interest_chocolate-1" class="about-interests-block-image" loading="lazy" fetchpriority="auto" decoding="async"><span id="image-description-interest_chocolate-1" class="visually-hidden">A freshly baked chocolate babka with dark chocolate swirled through its braided top sits on a white plate held by Tim. Several small candles are lit across the top of the loaf, representing Tim’s interest in baking and chocolatiering.</span>
        <h3 class="about-interest-caption">
          Baking and Chocolatiering
        </h3>

      </article>

      <article class="about-interests-block">

        <img src="/media/interests-and-hobbies-neapolitan-pizza-800x602.webp" alt="Homemade Neapolitan-style pizza" width="800" height="602" aria-describedby="image-description-interest_pizza-1" class="about-interests-block-image" loading="lazy" fetchpriority="auto" decoding="async"><span id="image-description-interest_pizza-1" class="visually-hidden">A homemade Neapolitan-style pizza rests on a round wooden board beside a pizza oven. Its puffy, blistered and lightly charred crust surrounds tomato sauce, melted cheese, and several fresh basil leaves, representing Tim’s interest in pizza making.</span>
        <h3 class="about-interest-caption">
          Pizza Making
        </h3>

      </article>

      <article class="about-interests-block">

        <img src="/media/profile-pic-tim-gabaree-geeking-out-800x533.webp" alt="Tim exploring technology" width="800" height="533" aria-describedby="image-description-interest_technology-1" class="about-interests-block-image" loading="lazy" fetchpriority="auto" decoding="async"><span id="image-description-interest_technology-1" class="visually-hidden">Illustrated portrait of Tim smiling and wearing dark-framed glasses and a dark shirt. Behind him, a stylized technology-themed background contains circuit traces, data-chart symbols, and the outline of a human head containing a gear, representing Tim’s interest in artificial intelligence and emerging technology.</span>
        <h3 class="about-interest-caption">
          AI &amp; Emerging Technology
        </h3>

      </article>

    </div>

  </section>

<!-- End Personal Interests Section -->

<!-- Contact Section -->

  <section
    class="about-contact"
    aria-labelledby="about-contact-title">

    <div class="contact-class">

      <h2 id="about-contact-title">
        Let’s Connect
      </h2>

      <div class="qr-code-block">

          <a class="qr-code-stack qr-code-caption-link"
            href="/contact"
            aria-label="Open Tim Gabaree’s contact page">

            <span><img src="/media/qr-code-tim-gabaree-500x500.webp" alt="QR code to Tim Gabaree’s contact page" width="500" height="500" loading="lazy" fetchpriority="auto" decoding="async"></span>
          <span class="qr-code-caption">
              Scan or click to connect
          </span>
          </a>

      </div>

      <address class="contact-content">

        <span>
          Tim Gabaree        </span>

        <span>
          <a
            href="tel:+15717623769"
            class="contactLink">
            571.762.3769          </a>
        </span>

        <span>
          <a
            href="mailto:tim@timgabaree.com"
